================================================================================
 HOW TO OBTAIN SOURCE CODE (GPL-3.0 Section 6)
================================================================================

The complete source code for MuseScore OH, including:

  - All ArkTS/ArkUI application code (entry/src/main/ets/)
  - All native C++ code (entry/src/main/cpp-engine/)
  - All CMake build scripts and toolchain configuration
  - All rcc-generated resource files (entry/src/main/cpp-engine/generated/)
  - Instructions for rebuilding the complete application

is available at the project repository.

The application incorporates source code from MuseScore Studio
(https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore), also licensed under GPL-3.0,
and the Muse Framework (https://github.com/musescore/muse_framework),
also licensed under GPL-3.0.

================================================================================
 FONT EMBEDDING EXCEPTION
================================================================================

All fonts included in MuseScore OH (compiled into libmsohengine.so as Qt
resources) are made available under the SIL Open Font License or the
GNU Freefont License, and are covered by the following special exception:

- If you create a document which uses fonts included in MuseScore OH,
and embed this font or unaltered portions of this font into the document,
then this font does not by itself cause the resulting document to be
covered by the GNU General Public License. This exception does not
however invalidate any other reasons why the document might be covered
by the GNU General Public License. If you modify this font, you may
extend this exception to your version of the font, but you are not
obligated to do so. If you do not wish to do so, delete this exception
statement from your version.

