================================================================================
 QT LGPL-3.0 COMPLIANCE
================================================================================

Qt 6.12 is dynamically linked (.so files shipped alongside the application).
Users can replace these .so files with a modified version of Qt.

The Qt for OpenHarmony port patches applied to the x86_64 self-built kit
(src/plugins/platforms/minimal/qminimalintegration.cpp) are modifications
to LGPL-3.0 licensed code. The modified source is available in the project
build toolchain at: qt-x64-kit-src/qtbase/

The Qt for OpenHarmony port patches applied to MuseScore's muse framework
(muse/framework/draw/internal/qpainterprovider.cpp and
muse/framework/draw/internal/qpainterprovider.h) are modifications to
GPL-3.0 licensed code, distributed as part of this project's source.

